simulated trajectories for a hybrid system, here are the findings:

### 1. Phase Lag: Is the simulation switching too early or too late?
The simulation is **switching too late**. 

Throughout the entire time series (from $t=0$ to $t=10$), there is a consistent 
phase lag. Every peak (switching from increasing to decreasing) and every trough
(switching from decreasing to increasing) in the simulated trajectory 
(dash-dotted line with triangles) occurs slightly after the corresponding peak 
